#: package/description
msgid "EGAnetLab brings the network psychometrics methods of the EGAnet package to jamovi and pairs every result with evidence-based methodological guidance, interpretation and educational support. It estimates the number and content of dimensions with Exploratory Graph Analysis and, in later releases, adds bootstrap stability, redundancy analysis (UVA), hierarchical, dynamic and invariance extensions. Every method-backed table cites its own source in jamovi's native numbered format, and the complete APA 7th edition bibliography lives in the module's documentation."
msgstr ""

